"815\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">by natural law + reason</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Natural rights: life,</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">liberty, property</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Government created to</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">protect those rights</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"565\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Limited power, consent</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">of the governed required</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"20\">Source: Two Treatises</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"740\" width=\"800\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">America chose Locke.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">The choice shaped everything that followed.</text></svg>",
