            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">MODERN STRESS TESTS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Where checks are tested today</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">EXECUTIVE ORDERS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">DACA, travel ban, loan forgiveness</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"325\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"375\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">FILIBUSTER</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"415\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">60-vote threshold not in Constitution</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"460\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">WAR POWERS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"550\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">No formal war declaration since 1941</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"595\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"645\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ADMINISTRATIVE STATE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">Loper Bright (2024) reset agency deference</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"730\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">EMERGENCY POWERS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"820\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">National Emergencies Act invocations</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"880\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"935\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">A check only works if branches USE it</text></svg>",
            "caption": "The Constitution is only as strong as those defending it"
