" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">5. NOT COERCIVE</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">no \"gun to the head\" (NFIB v. Sebelius limit)</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"790\" width=\"700\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">5 FACTORS, ONE QUESTION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"890\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Can the federal carrot become a stick?</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Dole's five tests for conditioned federal money"
