            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PRACTICE: REAL CONFLICT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">California emissions vs. federal preemption</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">THE CONFLICT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">California 2035 ban + Air Resources Board</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"350\" width=\"490\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">FOR CA</text><text x=\"305\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">10th Amendment +</text><text x=\"305\" y=\"495\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">CAA waiver framework</text><text x=\"305\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">In-state sales rule</text><text x=\"305\" y=\"590\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">No genuine conflict</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"350\" width=\"490\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"815\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">FOR MFR</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">CAA preempts emissions</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"495\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"19\">absent express waiver</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">De facto national standard</text><text x=\"815\" y=\"590\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">Dormant Commerce Clause</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"710\" width=\"900\" height=\"260\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"765\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">EVERY FEDERALISM CASE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">looks like this: state policy vs. federal preemption</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">two credible arguments on every side</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Train your ear for the textures</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Real federalism cases have two real sides"
