            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">CIVIC ENGAGEMENT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Beyond voting</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">1. CONTACT REPRESENTATIVES</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">call, write, email - calls work best</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"275\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">2. ATTEND PUBLIC MEETINGS</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">school board, city council, hearings</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"370\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">3. SUBMIT PUBLIC COMMENTS</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"435\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Federal Register, local zoning, ordinances</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"465\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">4. ORGANIZE</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">parties, civic groups, registration drives</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"560\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">5. RUN FOR OFFICE</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">~519,000 elected offices nationwide</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"655\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">6. SERVE ON BOARDS</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"720\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">planning, library, civil service</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"750\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">7. SUPPORT FREE PRESS + RULE OF LAW</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">subscribe, defend independence</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"845\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">8. INTELLECTUAL HONESTY</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"910\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">test beliefs, read across the aisle</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Eight ways to be more than a voter"
