            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PRESIDENTIAL POWER</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Expansion vs. constitutional design</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">WHERE POWER HAS EXPANDED</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Executive orders</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Administrative rulemaking</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">War powers (no decl. since 1942)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Emergency powers + tariffs</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Immigration enforcement</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Loper Bright (2024) trimmed Chevron</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"530\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"585\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">CONGRESS PUSHES BACK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"635\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Subpoena + investigations</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Power of the purse</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"705\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Impeachment + confirmation</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"770\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">THE CORE QUESTION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">When Congress delegates,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">who is governing?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Article I vs. Article II in practice</text></svg>",
            "caption": "The framers' design vs. the modern drift"
