            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE CITIZEN'S TOOLKIT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">What you have after 12 lessons</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">KNOWLEDGE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Founding documents + 3 branches</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Federalism + Bill of Rights</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Elections + citizenship</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"430\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">SKILLS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Read SCOTUS opinions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Track bills + contact reps</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Attend meetings + plan projects</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"670\" width=\"940\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">HABITS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"775\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">1 opinion / month, 1 bill / Congress</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"810\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">2 contacts / year, 1 meeting / quarter</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Vote EVERY election</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"885\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Read across the aisle</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"930\" width=\"700\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"980\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">The framers were betting on you</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Knowledge + skills + habits = active citizenship"
