            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PRACTICE: BRIEF AN OPINION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Six-part brief</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">1. CAPTION + CITATION</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">parties, U.S. Reports, year</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"285\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">2. FACTS</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">2-3 sentences - what happened</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"380\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"415\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">3. ISSUE</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">\"Whether...\" - the precise question</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"475\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">4. HOLDING</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">the Court's answer</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"570\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">5. REASONING</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"635\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">3-5 sentences + a quoted passage</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"665\" width=\"940\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">6. SIGNIFICANCE</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">what changes, what stays</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"770\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">SUGGESTED CASES</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Loper Bright (2024)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Dobbs (2022) | Bruen (2022)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"955\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">30-60 minutes per opinion</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Read it, brief it, know it"
