            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PRACTICE: TRACK A BILL</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">30-day worksheet</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">DAY 1 - SETUP</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Find on congress.gov</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Sponsor + cosponsors + committee</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Set alerts; read CRS summary</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"410\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">DAYS 1-15 - TRACK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"515\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Log committee actions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"550\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Note member positions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"585\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">CBO score, hearings, markups</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"630\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">DAYS 15-30 - ENGAGE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Contact your members</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Attend or watch a hearing</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Take TWO concrete actions</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"850\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">DAY 30 - FINAL REPORT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"930\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">stage, probability, lessons learned</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"970\" width=\"700\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"18\">More informed than 95% of voters</text></svg>",
            "caption": "30 days that change how you read the news"
